									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8923#msg8923">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #32 on:</b> July 01, 2004, 10:08:55 pm &#187;</span></td>
