								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Not sure I want to spend the time trolling this thread to lure out Retrievel so he can show off how retarded he is, so this may not get fun at all.</div><br />Wtf Grem .. I haven&#039;t even posted on any RN boards in like a year ... did you miss me that much?&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />I wasnt at this FR kill but all he is saying that consdiering the fact the guy asked to come along and he could have been more courteous.&nbsp; If I went on an Ascent raid as a guest I would at least listen to raid leader and follow directions.
						</td>
