							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yes Brews were heading to do Grummus when we seen this Alliance outside PoD after we talked to there raid leader we pulled away from doing Grummus since this was going to be there first try at it.<br />We found out less than 20 minutes time later Hegemony walked over them and ran to Grummus did not know some in Hegemony still needed this flag.
