							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Now the other question that i&#039;m sure that you wouldn&#039;t be mentioning is how long where you waitting to try grummus ?  If you needed grummus and were stalling for more people to get on then your SOL really.  No guild is gonna wait for you to get as many people on as you can when they have the force ready to take the mob down.  Now if you where on your way and have already started the ball rolling then shame on Hegemony but if thats the other way around and you were stalling for more people to get on to be able to take him down then here&#039;s your straw.  <br /><br /><br /><br /><br />EDIT:spelling
