									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=732022&quot; target=_new" target="_blank"><img src="http://img.villagephotos.com/p/2004-7/786521/nosterafusig(Custom).JPG" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
