	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9880"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=759" title="View the profile of Spirit">Spirit</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=759"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg9880#msg9880"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg9880#msg9880">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #44 on:</b> August 09, 2004, 03:13:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The Ally was set up and ready to go before Heg got there.  Yea it took us awhile to get set up, 3 guilds, full raid, instructions etc.   Heg got there maybe 10 mins before we were to move.  They undoubtedly knew what was going on.    I see it as a capable guild able to CTA people in a matter of minutes for grummus or any other lower flag, they should be able to take him anytime, why trample on 72 other people to do it now?   As smaller guilds having to use allies etc it takes us longer to get organized, is that a reason to pass right by them to take there target?  <br />I can&#039;t say for the other 71 people but I&#039;m sure I am not alone.  I will never have respect for anyone with a Hegemony tag again.  
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
